        "questionHtml": "<section class=\"listening-source-group\" data-question-start=\"31\" data-question-end=\"40\" data-question-type=\"sentence-completion\"><header class=\"listening-source-header\"><p class=\"listening-source-range\">Questions 31-40</p><p class=\"listening-source-instruction\">Complete the notes below. Write ONE WORD ONLY.</p></header><div class=\"listening-source-question-list\" role=\"list\"><p class=\"listening-source-title\"><strong>BUSINESS CULTURE</strong></p><p class=\"listening-source-title\"><strong>Power Culture</strong></p><p class=\"listening-source-title\">Characteristics of organization: small</p><div class=\"listening-source-question-row\" data-question-row=\"31\" role=\"listitem\"><span aria-label=\"Blank for question 31\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"31\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(31)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span> power source</div><div class=\"listening-source-support-row\">Few rules and procedures</div><div class=\"listening-source-question-row\" data-question-row=\"32\" role=\"listitem\">Communication by  <span aria-label=\"Blank for question 32\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"32\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(32)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span></div><div class=\"listening-source-support-row\">Advantage: can act quickly</div><div class=\"listening-source-question-row\" data-question-row=\"33\" role=\"listitem\">Disadvantage: might not act  <span aria-label=\"Blank for question 33\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"33\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(33)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span></div><div class=\"listening-source-question-row\" data-question-row=\"34\" role=\"listitem\">Suitable employee: not afraid of  <span aria-label=\"Blank for question 34\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"34\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(34)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span></div></div><p>Does not need job security</p><div class=\"listening-source-question-list\" role=\"list\"><p class=\"listening-source-title\"><strong>Role Culture</strong></p><div class=\"listening-source-question-row\" data-question-row=\"35\" role=\"listitem\">Characteristic of organization: large, many  <span aria-label=\"Blank for question 35\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"35\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(35)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span></div><div class=\"listening-source-support-row\">Specialized departments</div><div class=\"listening-source-question-row\" data-question-row=\"36\" role=\"listitem\">Rules and procedures e.g. job  <span aria-label=\"Blank for question 36\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"36\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(36)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span> and rules for discipline</div><div class=\"listening-source-support-row\">Advantages: economies of scale</div><div class=\"listening-source-question-row\" data-question-row=\"37\" role=\"listitem\">Successful when  <span aria-label=\"Blank for question 37\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"37\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(37)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span> ability is important</div><div class=\"listening-source-question-row\" data-question-row=\"38\" role=\"listitem\">Disadvantages: slow to see when  <span aria-label=\"Blank for question 38\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"38\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(38)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span> is needed</div><div class=\"listening-source-support-row\">Slow to react</div><div class=\"listening-source-support-row\">Suitable employee: values security</div><div class=\"listening-source-question-row\" data-question-row=\"39\" role=\"listitem\">Does not want  <span aria-label=\"Blank for question 39\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"39\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(39)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span></div></div><div class=\"listening-source-note-block\"><div class=\"listening-source-note-row\"><strong>Task Culture</strong></div><div class=\"listening-source-note-row\">Characteristic of organization: project oriented</div><div class=\"listening-source-note-row\">In competitive market or making product with short life</div><div class=\"listening-source-note-row\">Advantages:  <span aria-label=\"Blank for question 40\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"40\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(40)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span></div></div></section>",
        "startSeconds": 1185.38,
